sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant AdminDashboard as Admin Dashboard (React)
    participant ApiCore as api-core (NestJS)
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Admin->>AdminDashboard: Enter email + password
    AdminDashboard->>ApiCore: POST /api/admin/auth/login {email, password}
    ApiCore->>Redis: Check rate limit (5 attempts/15min per IP+email)
    alt Rate limit exceeded
        ApiCore-->>AdminDashboard: 429 Too Many Requests
    else Within limit
        ApiCore->>DB: Lookup AdminUser by email
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Verify password (argon2)
        alt Invalid credentials
            ApiCore->>Redis: Increment failed attempts
            ApiCore-->>AdminDashboard: 401 Unauthorized
        else Valid credentials
            ApiCore->>DB: Create RefreshToken
            ApiCore->>DB: Update last_login_at
            ApiCore-->>AdminDashboard: 200 {accessJWT} + Set-Cookie (refreshToken, httpOnly)
        end
    end

    Note over AdminDashboard: Access JWT stored in memory (not localStorage)

    AdminDashboard->>ApiCore: GET /api/admin/** (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    alt JWT valid
        ApiCore-->>AdminDashboard: 200 OK
    else JWT expired
        AdminDashboard->>ApiCore: POST /api/admin/auth/refresh
        ApiCore->>DB: Verify RefreshToken (not revoked, not expired)
        alt Refresh valid
            ApiCore-->>AdminDashboard: 200 {newAccessJWT}
            AdminDashboard->>ApiCore: Retry original request with new JWT
        else Refresh expired
            ApiCore-->>AdminDashboard: 401
            AdminDashboard->>Admin: Redirect to /login
        end
    end

    Admin->>AdminDashboard: Click Logout
    AdminDashboard->>ApiCore: POST /api/admin/auth/logout
    ApiCore->>DB: Revoke RefreshToken
    ApiCore-->>AdminDashboard: 200
    AdminDashboard->>Admin: Redirect to /login
